ions Imbriqu=C3=A9es avec des <strong data-start=3D"4358" data-end=3D"4381"=
>op=C3=A9rateurs logiques</strong> (AND, OR, NOT)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4531" class=3D"">Les op=C3=A9rateurs log=
iques (<code data-start=3D"4423" data-end=3D"4428">and</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"4430" data-end=3D"4434">or</code>, <code data-start=3D"4436" data-e=
nd=3D"4441">not</code>) sont souvent utilis=C3=A9s dans les conditions imbr=
iqu=C3=A9es pour combiner plusieurs conditions.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4533" data-end=3D"4743">
<li data-start=3D"4533" data-end=3D"4609" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4535" data-end=3D"4609" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
535" data-end=3D"4544"><code data-start=3D"4537" data-end=3D"4542">and</cod=
e></strong> : La condition est vraie si <strong data-start=3D"4573" data-en=
d=3D"4608">les deux conditions sont vraies</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4610" data-end=3D"4684" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4612" data-end=3D"4684" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
612" data-end=3D"4620"><code data-start=3D"4614" data-end=3D"4618">or</code=
></strong> : La condition est vraie si <strong data-start=3D"4649" data-end=
=3D"4683">l'une des conditions est vraie</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4685" data-end=3D"4743" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4687" data-end=3D"4743" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
687" data-end=3D"4696"><code data-start=3D"4689" data-end=3D"4694">not</cod=
e></strong> : Inverse la valeur bool=C3=A9enne de la condition.</p>
</li>
</ul>
