 la Recherche Binaire</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5641" data-end=3D"6112">
<li data-start=3D"5641" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5643" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
