ong>, car elle ne n=C3=A9cessite qu'un nombre constant de variables suppl=
=C3=A9mentaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6114" data-end=3D"6148" class=3D"">3.5 Avantages et Incon=
v=C3=A9nients</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6150" data-end=3D"6573">
<li data-start=3D"6150" data-end=3D"6374" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6152" data-end=3D"6167" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
