<ul data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6374">
<li data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6254" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6172" data-end=3D"6254" class=3D"">Tr=C3=A8s rapide pour d=
e grandes collections tri=C3=A9es, avec une complexit=C3=A9 logarithmique.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6257" data-end=3D"6371" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6259" data-end=3D"6371" class=3D"">Peut =C3=AAtre utilis=
=C3=A9e efficacement pour de grandes quantit=C3=A9s de donn=C3=A9es o=C3=B9=
 la recherche lin=C3=A9aire serait trop lente.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6375" data-end=3D"6573" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6377" data-end=3D"6396" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
