<ul data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6573">
<li data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6401" data-end=3D"6440" class=3D"">N=C3=A9cessite que la c=
ollection soit tri=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6443" data-end=3D"6573" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6445" data-end=3D"6573" class=3D"">Pas efficace si la coll=
