<h2 data-start=3D"6189" data-end=3D"6221" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=8D 4. Tri Ra=
pide (Quick Sort)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6223" data-end=3D"6243" class=3D"">4.1 Pr=C3=A9sentation<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"6245" data-end=3D"6364" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"6248" data-end=3D"6262">tri rapide</strong> (Quick Sort) est un algorit=
hme de tri <strong data-start=3D"6301" data-end=3D"6324">diviser pour r=C3=
=A9gner</strong> qui fonctionne de la mani=C3=A8re suivante :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6365" data-end=3D"6627">
<li data-start=3D"6365" data-end=3D"6418" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6418" class=3D"">Choisissez un =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ment de la liste comme <strong data-start=3D"6408" data-end=3D"6417">=
pivot</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6419" data-end=3D"6564" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6422" data-end=3D"6564" class=3D"">Partitionnez la liste e=
n deux sous-listes : une contenant les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments plus petits que l=
e pivot et l'autre contenant les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments plus grands.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6565" data-end=3D"6627" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6568" data-end=3D"6627" class=3D"">Appliquez r=C3=A9cursiv=
ement le tri rapide aux deux sous-listes.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6629" data-end=3D"6651" class=3D"">4.2 Fonctionnement</h3=
>
<ol data-start=3D"6653" data-end=3D"6953">
<li data-start=3D"6653" data-end=3D"6728" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"6728" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez un <s=
trong data-start=3D"6672" data-end=3D"6681">pivot</strong> (par exemple, le=
 dernier =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment de la liste).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6863" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6732" data-end=3D"6863" class=3D"">R=C3=A9organisez la lis=
te de mani=C3=A8re =C3=A0 ce que les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments plus petits que le =
pivot se trouvent avant lui et ceux plus grands apr=C3=A8s lui.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6864" data-end=3D"6953" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6867" data-end=3D"6953" class=3D"">Appliquez r=C3=A9cursiv=
ement le m=C3=AAme processus sur les deux sous-listes, excluant le pivot.</=
p>
</li>
</ol>
