<h3 data-start=3D"7639" data-end=3D"7671" class=3D"">4.4 Complexit=C3=A9 du=
 Tri Rapide</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7673" data-end=3D"8124">
<li data-start=3D"7673" data-end=3D"8012" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7675" data-end=3D"7686" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
675" data-end=3D"7684">Temps</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7689" data-end=3D"8012">
<li data-start=3D"7689" data-end=3D"7792" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7691" data-end=3D"7792" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"7699" data-end=3D"7719">meilleur des cas</strong> (partition =C3=A9q=
uilibr=C3=A9e), la <strong data-start=3D"7747" data-end=3D"7772">complexit=
=C3=A9 temporelle</strong> est <strong data-start=3D"7777" data-end=3D"7791=
">O(n log n)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7795" data-end=3D"8012" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7797" data-end=3D"8012" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"7805" data-end=3D"7821">pire des cas</strong> (pivot mal choisi, par=
