eut =C3=AAtre <strong data-start=3D"7908" data-end=3D"7917">O(n=C2=B2)</str=
ong>. Cependant, dans la pratique, cela peut =C3=AAtre =C3=A9vit=C3=A9 avec=
 une bonne strat=C3=A9gie de choix du pivot.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8014" data-end=3D"8124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8016" data-end=3D"8124" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
016" data-end=3D"8026">Espace</strong> : La <strong data-start=3D"8032" dat=
a-end=3D"8055">complexit=C3=A9 spatiale</strong> est <strong data-start=3D"=
8060" data-end=3D"8072">O(log n)</strong> dans le meilleur des cas en raiso=
n de la r=C3=A9cursion.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8126" data-end=3D"8160" class=3D"">4.5 Avantages et Incon=
v=C3=A9nients</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8162" data-end=3D"8502">
<li data-start=3D"8162" data-end=3D"8300" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8164" data-end=3D"8179" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
164" data-end=3D"8177">Avantages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8182" data-end=3D"8300">
<li data-start=3D"8182" data-end=3D"8234" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8184" data-end=3D"8234" class=3D"">Tr=C3=A8s rapide pour d=
es collections de grande taille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8237" data-end=3D"8300" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8239" data-end=3D"8300" class=3D"">Efficace dans la pratiq=
ue si le choix du pivot est bien fait.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8302" data-end=3D"8502" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8304" data-end=3D"8323" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
304" data-end=3D"8321">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8326" data-end=3D"8502">
<li data-start=3D"8326" data-end=3D"8425" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8328" data-end=3D"8425" class=3D"">Peut =C3=AAtre ineffica=
ce dans des sc=C3=A9narios extr=C3=AAmes (listes d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 tri=C3=A9es=
) si le pivot est mal choisi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8428" data-end=3D"8502" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8430" data-end=3D"8502" class=3D"">Plus complexe =C3=A0 im=
pl=C3=A9menter que le tri =C3=A0 bulles ou le tri par s=C3=A9lection.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
