<p data-start=3D"945" data-end=3D"1059" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=3D=
"948" data-end=3D"978">complexit=C3=A9 des algorithmes</strong> fait r=C3=
=A9f=C3=A9rence =C3=A0 l'=C3=A9valuation de <strong data-start=3D"1012" dat=
a-end=3D"1028">l'efficacit=C3=A9</strong> d'un algorithme en termes de :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1257">
<li data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1172" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1063" data-end=3D"1172" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
063" data-end=3D"1084">Temps d'ex=C3=A9cution</strong> : Le temps n=C3=A9ce=
