=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1173" data-end=3D"1257" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1175" data-end=3D"1257" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
175" data-end=3D"1193">Espace m=C3=A9moire</strong> : La quantit=C3=A9 de m=
=C3=A9moire n=C3=A9cessaire pour ex=C3=A9cuter l'algorithme.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1259" data-end=3D"1394" class=3D"">L'analyse de la complex=
it=C3=A9 aide =C3=A0 choisir l'algorithme le plus adapt=C3=A9 pour un probl=
=C3=A8me donn=C3=A9, en tenant compte des ressources limit=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1450" class=3D"">1.2 Notations Utilis=
=C3=A9es pour =C3=89valuer la Complexit=C3=A9</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1452" data-end=3D"1491" class=3D"">Les notations standard =
utilis=C3=A9es sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1493" data-end=3D"1841">
<li data-start=3D"1493" data-end=3D"1605" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1495" data-end=3D"1605" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
495" data-end=3D"1508">Big-O (O)</strong> : La <strong data-start=3D"1514" =
data-end=3D"1535">limite sup=C3=A9rieure</strong> de la complexit=C3=A9 tem=
porelle ou spatiale. Elle d=C3=A9crit le <strong data-start=3D"1592" data-e=
nd=3D"1604">pire cas</strong>.</p>
