<h3 data-start=3D"4821" data-end=3D"4846" class=3D"">3.2 Types de M=C3=A9th=
odes</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4848" data-end=3D"5436">
<li data-start=3D"4848" data-end=3D"5007" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4851" data-end=3D"5007" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
