<li data-start=3D"5009" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5012" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
012" data-end=3D"5034">M=C3=A9thodes de classe</strong> : Ces m=C3=A9thodes=
