<h4 data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4141" class=3D"">Explication :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4142" data-end=3D"4506">
<li data-start=3D"4142" data-end=3D"4308" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4144" data-end=3D"4308" class=3D"">Les attributs <code dat=
a-start=3D"4158" data-end=3D"4165">__nom</code> et <code data-start=3D"4169=
" data-end=3D"4176">__age</code> sont rendus priv=C3=A9s par les doubles un=
derscores (<code data-start=3D"4225" data-end=3D"4229">__</code>). Cela emp=
=C3=AAche l'acc=C3=A8s direct =C3=A0 ces attributs depuis l'ext=C3=A9rieur =
de la classe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4309" data-end=3D"4506" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4311" data-end=3D"4506" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"4315" data-end=3D"4335">m=C3=A9thodes d'acc=C3=A8s</strong> (<code data=
-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4346">get_nom</code>, <code data-start=3D"4348"=
