 la m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"3505" data-end=3D"3513">parler</code> =
de <code data-start=3D"3517" data-end=3D"3525">Animal</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3527" data-end=3D"3682" class=3D"">
