<h2 data-start=3D"7112" data-end=3D"7131" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=84 6. Conclu=
sion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7133" data-end=3D"7334" class=3D"">La fonction <strong dat=
a-start=3D"7145" data-end=3D"7158"><code data-start=3D"7147" data-end=3D"71=
56">super()</code></strong> est un outil puissant en <strong data-start=3D"=
