<h4 data-start=3D"4089" data-end=3D"4107" class=3D"">Explication :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4496">
<li data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4170" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4110" data-end=3D"4170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
110" data-end=3D"4119"><code data-start=3D"4112" data-end=3D"4117">try</cod=
e></strong> : Contient le code qui peut g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer une exception.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4171" data-end=3D"4254" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4173" data-end=3D"4254" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
173" data-end=3D"4185"><code data-start=3D"4175" data-end=3D"4183">except</=
code></strong> : Capture l'exception et ex=C3=A9cute un code sp=C3=A9cifiqu=
e pour la traiter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4255" data-end=3D"4331" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
257" data-end=3D"4267"><code data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4265">else</co=
de></strong> : Ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 si aucune exception n'a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 lev=
=C3=A9e dans le bloc <code data-start=3D"4325" data-end=3D"4330">try</code>=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4496" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4334" data-end=3D"4496" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
334" data-end=3D"4347"><code data-start=3D"4336" data-end=3D"4345">finally<=
/code></strong> : Ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 =C3=A0 la fin, que l'exception se produ=
ise ou non, id=C3=A9al pour les t=C3=A2ches de nettoyage (par exemple, ferm=
er un fichier ou une connexion r=C3=A9seau).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4498" data-end=3D"4532" class=3D"">2.2 Propagation des Ex=
ceptions</h3>
