<li data-start=3D"9601" data-end=3D"9749" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9603" data-end=3D"9749" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
603" data-end=3D"9632">Documenter les exceptions</strong> : Expliquez dans =
la documentation des fonctions quelles exceptions peuvent =C3=AAtre lev=C3=
=A9es et comment elles sont g=C3=A9r=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9750" data-end=3D"9870" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9752" data-end=3D"9870" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
