</li>
<li data-start=3D"9779" data-end=3D"9818" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9781" data-end=3D"9818" class=3D"">Conditions impr=C3=A9vu=
es ou ind=C3=A9sirables.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9819" data-end=3D"9892" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9821" data-end=3D"9892" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes externes=
 comme des erreurs de r=C3=A9seau ou d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 un fichier=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
