<li data-start=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1478" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1478" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
432" data-end=3D"1441"><code data-start=3D"1434" data-end=3D"1439">pdb</cod=
e></strong> : Le d=C3=A9bogueur interactif de Python.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1479" data-end=3D"1591" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1481" data-end=3D"1591" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
481" data-end=3D"1494"><code data-start=3D"1483" data-end=3D"1492">logging<=
/code></strong> : Une biblioth=C3=A8que pour enregistrer des messages de lo=
g, utile pour diagnostiquer des probl=C3=A8mes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1673" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1673" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
594" data-end=3D"1610">Outils tiers</strong> : Comme <strong data-start=3D"=
