<hr data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4111" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4113" data-end=3D"4161" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B8 5. Assert=
ions dans les tests avec <code data-start=3D"4153" data-end=3D"4161">pytest=
</code></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4163" data-end=3D"4294" class=3D"">Les assertions sont le =
c=C5=93ur des tests dans <code data-start=3D"4206" data-end=3D"4214">pytest=
</code>. Elles permettent de v=C3=A9rifier que les valeurs attendues et r=
=C3=A9elles sont =C3=A9gales.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4296" data-end=3D"4330" class=3D"">Types d'assertions cou=
rantes :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4630">
<li data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4396" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4334" data-end=3D"4396" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
334" data-end=3D"4351"><code data-start=3D"4336" data-end=3D"4349">assert e=
xpr</code></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie que l'expression <code data-start=3D"437=
9" data-end=3D"4385">expr</code> est vraie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4468" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4399" data-end=3D"4468" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
399" data-end=3D"4426"><code data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4424">assert e=
xpr1 =3D=3D expr2</code></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie que <code data-start=3D"44=
41" data-end=3D"4448">expr1</code> est =C3=A9gal =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D=
"4460" data-end=3D"4467">expr2</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4546" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4471" data-end=3D"4546" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
471" data-end=3D"4498"><code data-start=3D"4473" data-end=3D"4496">assert e=
xpr1 !=3D expr2</code></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie que <code data-start=3D"4513=
" data-end=3D"4520">expr1</code> n'est pas =C3=A9gal =C3=A0 <code data-star=
t=3D"4538" data-end=3D"4545">expr2</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4630" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4630" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
549" data-end=3D"4579"><code data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4577">assert e=
xpr in container</code></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie que <code data-start=3D"459=
4" data-end=3D"4600">expr</code> est contenu dans <code data-start=3D"4618"=
 data-end=3D"4629">container</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
