<h2 data-start=3D"8368" data-end=3D"8418" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B8 5. Compar=
aison entre <strong data-start=3D"8395" data-end=3D"8404">Flask</strong> et=
 <strong data-start=3D"8408" data-end=3D"8418">Django</strong></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"8420" data-end=3D"9002">
<li data-start=3D"8420" data-end=3D"8692" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8422" data-end=3D"8433" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
422" data-end=3D"8431">Flask</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8436" data-end=3D"8692">
<li data-start=3D"8436" data-end=3D"8471" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8438" data-end=3D"8471" class=3D"">Micro-framework, l=C3=
=A9ger, flexible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8474" data-end=3D"8518" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8476" data-end=3D"8518" class=3D"">Id=C3=A9al pour des pro=
jets simples ou des API.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8521" data-end=3D"8573" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8523" data-end=3D"8573" class=3D"">Offre plus de libert=C3=
=A9 pour organiser votre projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8576" data-end=3D"8692" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8578" data-end=3D"8692" class=3D"">N=C3=A9cessite des exte=
nsions pour des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s avanc=C3=A9es comme l'authentification=
, la gestion des sessions, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8694" data-end=3D"9002" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8696" data-end=3D"8708" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
696" data-end=3D"8706">Django</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8711" data-end=3D"9002">
<li data-start=3D"8711" data-end=3D"8760" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8713" data-end=3D"8760" class=3D"">Framework complet, offr=
e une structure stricte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8763" data-end=3D"8831" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8765" data-end=3D"8831" class=3D"">Id=C3=A9al pour des app=
lications complexes avec des exigences robustes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8834" data-end=3D"8921" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8836" data-end=3D"8921" class=3D"">Inclut des fonctionnali=
t=C3=A9s pr=C3=AAtes =C3=A0 l'emploi (authentification, ORM, administration=
).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8924" data-end=3D"9002" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8926" data-end=3D"9002" class=3D"">Peut =C3=AAtre un peu p=
lus rigide et difficile =C3=A0 personnaliser dans certains cas.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
